<h3> PAPERS - TALKS - CONFERENCE PRESENTATIONS</h3>
<p>The KITION PLANETARIUM &amp; OBSERVATORY publishes <strong>SCIENTIFIC PAPERS</strong> related to the research done by its team at the science center.</p>
<p>Its team GIVES <strong>SCIENTIFIC TALKS</strong> and participates in <strong>CONFERENCE PRESENTATIONS</strong> in Cyprus and abroad.</p>
<div class="block"><h2>PAPERS</h2></div>
