<dl class="specs"><dt><strong>Published in</strong></dt><dd> <a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/conhome/8419341/proceeding" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="2018 International Conference on Engineering Technologies and Computer Science (EnT)">2018 International Conference on Engineering Technologies and Computer Science (EnT)</a></dd><dt><strong>Date of Conference</strong></dt><dd> 20-21 March 2018</dd><dt><strong>Date Added to IEEE <em>Xplore</em></strong></dt><dd> 26 July 2018</dd><dt><strong>INSPEC Accession Number</strong></dt><dd> 17957062</dd><dt><strong>DOI</strong></dt><dd> <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/EnT.2018.00028" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" title="DOI 10.1109/EnT.2018.00028">10.1109/EnT.2018.00028</a></dd></dl>
